# Admin surfaces pattern (`ads-*`)

Use for **non-table** admin pages: dashboards, overview stats, quick actions, dialogs.

Pair with **adt-*** table kit on list pages that also have a stats row.

## Setup

```blade
<x-admin.surface-styles />

<div class="main-content admin-surface">
    {{-- ads-* content --}}
</div>
```

Table + stats page:

```blade
<x-admin.surface-styles />
<x-admin.data-table-styles />

<div class="main-content admin-data-table">
    {{-- ads-page-header, ads-stats, then adt-panel table --}}
</div>
```

Layout must have `@stack('styles')` in `<head>`.

## Class reference

| Area | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page header | `ads-page-header`, `ads-page-title`, `ads-page-subtitle`, `ads-page-actions`, `ads-filters` |
| Buttons / filters | `ads-btn-primary`, `ads-select`, `ads-select-narrow` |
| Sections | `ads-section`, `ads-section-title`, `ads-section-card`, `ads-section-meta` |
| Stats | `ads-stats`, `ads-stat`, `ads-stat-inner`, `ads-stat-icon`, `ads-stat-label`, `ads-stat-value`, `ads-stat-highlight` |
| Panels | `ads-panel`, `ads-panel-header`, `ads-panel-title`, `ads-panel-body` |
| Alerts | `ads-alert`, `ads-alert-success`, `ads-alert-error` |
| Quick actions | `ads-quick-actions`, `ads-quick-action`, `ads-quick-action-icon` |
| Modal | `ads-modal-overlay`, `ads-modal-dialog`, `ads-modal-card`, `ads-modal-header`, `ads-modal-body`, `ads-modal-footer` |

