## Layout requirement

Parent layout must include `@stack('styles')` and `@stack('scripts')` in `<head>` / before `</body>`.

## Rules

- Neutral palette; shared tokens via `ui-tokens.blade.php` (`--adt-primary` etc.).
- No rainbow Bootstrap stat cards (`bg-primary`, `bg-success`, …).
- Primary buttons: `btn btn-primary btn-sm ads-btn-primary text-white`.
- Modals: Livewire `ads-modal-*` overlay — **not** Bootstrap Modal.
- Section titles: small uppercase `ads-section-title`, not heavy card headers.
- **Elevated look** applies only on `.admin-surface` (dashboards): hero header, `ads-section-card`, stat shadows, icon tiles. Table pages (`.admin-data-table`) keep flat stats.

